* The shared memory segment is created in kernel space 
* Each process attaches this segment into its own user space address range 


Kernel Space vs User Space 
--------------------------

Kernel Space 

	* Maintains 

		* Key 
		* Shared memory ID 
		* Shared memory Segment 

ser Space (Per process) 

	* Code section	
	* Data section
	* Heap 
	* Stack 
	* Shared memory gets mapped somewhere between heap and stack 

